    <div class="math-stage-next"><span><strong>Two ways forward.</strong> Open the editor to search for a new path, or jump straight to inspect the selected sample and its stated evidence limits.</span><div class="math-stage-actions"><button type="button" class="button button-primary button-sm" data-math-jump="mathBuilderDisclosure">Next: search for a path →</button><button type="button" class="button button-outline button-sm" data-math-jump="mathResults">Inspect this example ↓</button></div></div>
